  "input_elements": [
    {
      "id": "i1",
      "content": "To begin the process, start with Low Inventory."
    },
    {
      "id": "i2",
      "content": "After that, proceed to Create P.R.."
    },
    {
      "id": "i3",
      "content": "Then, move on to Create P.R., followed by Submit P.O.."
    },
    {
      "id": "i4",
      "content": "Once the P.O. is submitted, proceed to Ship Material."
    },
    {
      "id": "i5",
      "content": "At this point, check if the shipment is okay. If it is, then proceed to Send Payment."
    },
    {
      "id": "i6",
      "content": "However, if there are any problems with the shipment, communicate them accordingly."
    },
    {
      "id": "i7",
      "content": "After checking the shipment status again, if it is okay, proceed to Send Payment."
    },
    {
      "id": "i8",
      "content": "Otherwise, communicate any shipment problems."
    },
    {
      "id": "i9",
      "content": "Finally, once the payment is sent, the process comes to an end."
    },
    {
      "id": "i10",
      "content": "In case there were any shipment problems, make sure to communicate them before proceeding to Ship Material."
    }
  ]
